# Important: data/, output/, and evidence/ are not ignored wholesale.
# Their committed fixtures and protected evidence require explicit review.

# Local test-runner caches and transient reports. These are reproducible and
# can contain machine-specific paths or runtime traces, so they are never part
# of the public source release.
